"matokeo ya awali. USIite chombo hiki tena kwa hoja sawa. Ikiwa kazi zaidi "
"itahitajika, piga simu kwa chombo tofauti au ujibu ukitumia ulicho nacho "
"tayari.\n"

#: src/uagent/llm_flow_helpers.py:271
msgid ""
"The previous model turn ended with an empty reply after tool use. Continue "
"the unfinished task using the most recent tool results. Prefer a concrete "
"next step or final answer over an empty response."
msgstr ""
"Zamu ya muundo uliopita iliisha kwa jibu tupu baada ya utumiaji wa zana. "
"Endelea na kazi ambayo haijakamilika kwa kutumia matokeo ya hivi majuzi "
"zaidi ya zana. Pendelea hatua madhubuti inayofuata au jibu la mwisho juu ya "
"jibu tupu."

#: src/uagent/llm_flow_helpers.py:409
msgid ""
"The previous assistant reply was empty. Please answer based on the most "
"recent tool result."
msgstr ""
"Jibu la awali la msaidizi lilikuwa tupu. Jibu kulingana na matokeo ya hivi "
"karibuni ya zana."

#: src/uagent/llm_flow_helpers.py:422
