"- Auto-pilot: `:auto <goal>` repeatedly runs a task; press `x` to exit "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"- Majaribio ya kiotomatiki: `:otomatiki <goal>` huendesha kazi mara kwa "
"mara; bonyeza `x` ili kuondoka mara moja."

