#: src/uagent/providers/llm_openai_responses.py:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[Tool calling rules]\n"
"        - When calling a tool/function, you MUST provide function_call.arguments as a JSON object.\n"
"        - The JSON object MUST include all required parameters defined by the tool schema.\n"
"        - Never call a tool with an empty object {} unless the tool has no required parameters.\n"
"        - If you do not have a required parameter, ask the user for it using human_ask instead of guessing.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"[Sheria za kupiga zana]\n"
"        - Unapopiga zana/funguzi, lazima utoe function_call.arguments kama kitu cha JSON.\n"
"        - Kitu cha JSON lazima kijumuishe vigezo vyote vinavyohitajika vilivyofafanuliwa na skima ya zana.\n"
"        - Kamwe usipige zana kwa kitu tupu {} isipokuwa zana haina vigezo vinavyohitajika.\n"
"        - Ikiwa huna kigezo kinachohitajika, muulize mtumiaji kupitia human_ask badala ya kubahatisha.\n"
"        "

#: src/uagent/providers/llm_openai_responses.py:29
msgid ""
"[Web search rules]\n"
"        - Use web search only when fresh or external information is necessary.\n"
"        - Do not use web search for local or stable information.\n"
"        - Prefer answering without web search when the answer is already sufficient.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"[Kanuni za utafutaji wa wavuti]\n"
"        - Tumia utafutaji wa wavuti tu wakati taarifa za karibuni au za nje zinahitajika.\n"
"        - Usitumie utafutaji wa wavuti kwa taarifa za mahali hapo au thabiti.\n"
"        - Pendelea kujibu bila utafutaji wa wavuti wakati jibu tayari linatosha.\n"
"        "

